<?xml version="1.0"?>
<ScenContainer xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xmlns:xsd="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema">
  <ScenTitle>Angamos Goes the Distance, 1980</ScenTitle>
  <ScenDescription>&lt;BODY scroll=auto&gt;&lt;P&gt;This scenario presents a fictional secret mission for a Peruvian submarine, which must conduct a covert extractional of Peruvian government personnel (i.e., spies) from Chile.&amp;nbsp; &lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt"&gt;-------------------------------------------------------&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;To rendevous with the government boat, move it and the submarine as close together as possible (i.e., within about one&amp;nbsp;hundred meters) and remain there until you receive a message telling you the extraction is complete.&amp;nbsp; At this point,&amp;nbsp;you can begin the journey back to Peru.&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;If the Chileans find you in their waters, they will shoot at you.&amp;nbsp; Make sure they are nowhere around before you enter the rendevous zone (which triggers the appearance of the government boat) and especially before you surface.&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;A delta template .ini file has been included in the .zip file to assist in updating the scenario to any future versions of the database.&amp;nbsp; &lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt"&gt;Scenario Author: Mark Gellis&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/BODY&gt;</ScenDescription>
